<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- The Golden Rules -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-amber-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
      <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-amber-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7-4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zM9 9a1 1 0 000 2v3a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 100-2v-3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
      </svg>
      The Mom Test Golden Rules
    </h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-2">👂</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Talk About Their Life</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Not your idea. Ask about their problems, not your solution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-2">🕐</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Ask About the Past</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Not hypotheticals. "When was the last time..." beats "Would you ever..."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-2">🤐</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Talk Less, Listen More</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">You're there to learn, not to pitch. Stay curious.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bad vs Good Questions -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

    <!-- Bad Questions -->
    <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-red-200">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        ❌ Bad Questions
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <span class="font-semibold">"Would you buy this product?"</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">→ People lie about future behavior</p>
        </li>
        <li class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <span class="font-semibold">"Do you think this is a good idea?"</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">→ Seeking compliments, not truth</p>
        </li>
        <li class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <span class="font-semibold">"Would you pay $X for this?"</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">→ Hypothetical commitment means nothing</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Good Questions -->
    <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-green-200">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        ✅ Good Questions
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <span class="font-semibold">"When was the last time you encountered [problem]?"</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">→ Validates the problem exists</p>
        </li>
        <li class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <span class="font-semibold">"What are you currently using to solve this?"</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">→ Reveals real behavior and budget</p>
        </li>
        <li class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <span class="font-semibold">"Can you walk me through how you do [task] today?"</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">→ Uncovers actual workflow and pain</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Interview Script Template -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Interview Script Template</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. Set the Stage (2 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">"Thanks for meeting with me. I'm researching [problem area] and would love to learn about your experience. Nothing to sell today - just want to understand how you work."</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. Understand Their World (10 min)</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>"Tell me about your role and what a typical day looks like."</li>
          <li>"What are the biggest challenges you face with [problem area]?"</li>
          <li>"When was the last time you dealt with [specific problem]?"</li>
          <li>"Walk me through exactly what happened."</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Dig into Current Solutions (8 min)</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>"What have you tried to solve this?"</li>
          <li>"What are you currently using? Show me."</li>
          <li>"What do you like about it? What frustrates you?"</li>
          <li>"How much does it cost? Who approved that purchase?"</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-orange-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Explore Their Process (8 min)</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>"Can you show me how you do [task] right now?"</li>
          <li>"What happens when things go wrong?"</li>
          <li>"How do other people on your team handle this?"</li>
          <li>"What would make this significantly better for you?"</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. The Commitment Ask (2 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">"I'm building something that might help with [their specific pain]. Would you be willing to try an early version?" or "Can you introduce me to others who face this problem?"</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 italic">Note: Only ask if the conversation went well and they clearly have the problem.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Signals to Watch For -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-blue-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Signals to Watch For</h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2">✅ Good Signs</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>• They complain without prompting</li>
          <li>• They show you their current solution</li>
          <li>• They've already spent money/time trying to solve it</li>
          <li>• They ask when they can use your solution</li>
          <li>• They offer to introduce you to others</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">❌ Red Flags</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>• "That's an interesting idea" (polite dismissal)</li>
          <li>• They say they'd "probably" use it</li>
          <li>• They ask you to keep them posted</li>
          <li>• They have workarounds they're happy with</li>
          <li>• They've never paid for anything similar</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
